# Architecture Validation Reconciliation — Controlled Execution Branch

**Date opened:** 2026-08-26  
**Parent chronology:** `project-guide/masterplan.md` §10 — Chronological Execution Plan  
**Branch section:** `project-guide/masterplan.md` §10A  
**Purpose:** reconcile the existing test suite with the current HomeFinder architecture before three-house allocation and SH3D merge work.

## Baseline

Executed from `active_development/`:

```text
node --test tests/*.test.mjs tests/*.test.js
```

Result:

| Metric | Result |
|---|---:|
| Tests | 106 |
| Passed | 46 |
| Failed | 60 |

These failures are classification evidence, not automatically product defects.

